<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωμός</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωμός</span></b>  (q.v.), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soup</i> or
				<i>sauce</i> to eat with meat, fish, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1174
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				716
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ζ. οἱ τῶν πιόνων</span>
			<i>soups</i> made from animals with soft fat (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιμελή</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				520a8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				651a29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. μέλας</span> black
			<i>broth</i> of the Spartans, <i><span class="en">
				Matro
				<u>Conv.</u>
				94
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>bloodshed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				8.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Com. name for
				<i>fat, greasy fellow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπαρὸς περιπατεῖ Δημοκλῆς, ζ.
					κατωνόμασται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxandr.
					34.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristopho
				4.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Alchemy,
				<i>wash</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Democr.
			</span></i>Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.48
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.169
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
